    source:{ name:"White House / Trump Admin", handle:"whitehouse", platform:"web", kind:"gov" },
    text:"President Trump signed an executive order directing all federal agencies to use the term 'Super Intelligence' or 'SI' instead of 'AI' when referring to artificial intelligence systems in official communications and policy documents, effective immediately. The order also covers usage in federal procurement, research grants, and public-facing agency websites.",
