    text:"OpenAI's annualized revenue run rate has climbed to nearly $70 billion, Axios reported Sept. 29 citing people familiar with the company's financials -- up from the roughly $40 billion pace Bloomberg and Forbes reported just last month. B2B revenue more than doubled since July, and OpenAI added more revenue in Q3 alone than in all of 2025, per the same reporting.",
